%22%20width%3D%221600%22%20height%3D%2231%22%20fill%3D%22%2308060e%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E')"></div><div class="wrap rv in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">About us</span></nav><span class="kicker">About us</span><h1>The people behind SOUND</h1><p>A small team that loves songs, stories and the languages they come in.</p></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap two-col"><div class="rv in"><span class="kicker">Our story</span><h2>Built for people who listen in more than one language</h2><p class="muted">SOUND is an entertainment website for music and videos. We host new releases and classics in English and regional languages. Browse by album, artist, year, genre or language, then rate and review what you watch and listen to.</p><p class="muted">Administrators add and organise content, and registered listeners rate and review it. That loop keeps the catalogue honest and the home page fresh.</p><a class="btn pri" href="music.html">Start listening<svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><div class="statbox rv in"><div><b>12</b><span>Songs</span></div><div><b>10</b><span>Videos</span></div><div><b>6</b><span>Artists</span></div><div><b>5</b><span>Languages</span></div></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="two-card"><article class="panel rv in"><span class="ico"><svg class="ic" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="6"></circle><path d="M8.5 14L7 22l5-3 5 3-1.5-8"></path></svg></span><h3>Our mission</h3><p class="muted">To give every song and video, new or old, in English or a regional language, a clear and well-credited home that listeners can search, rate and review.</p></article><article class="panel rv in"><span class="ico"><svg class="ic" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8S1 12 1 12z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></span><h3>Our vision</h3><p class="muted">A catalogue where a Punjabi folk song and an English pop track are equally easy to discover, and where listeners shape what rises to the top.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv in"><div><span class="kicker">Values</span><h2>What we stand for</h2></div></div><div class="svc-grid"><article class="svc rv in"><span class="ico"><svg class="ic" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 18v-6a9 9 0 0118 0v6"></path><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1v-7h3zM3 19a2 2 0 002 2h1v-7H3z"></path></svg></span><h3>Listeners first</h3><p class="muted">Fast pages, clear categories and honest ratings. Everything is built so people reach the song they want in a few clicks.</p></article><article class="svc rv in"><span class="ico"><svg class="ic" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 010 20M12 2a15 15 0 000 20"></path></svg></span><h3>Every language counts</h3><p class="muted">Regional music is not an add-on. It sits next to English releases with the same care and the same space.</p></article><article class="svc rv in"><span class="ico"><svg class="ic" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="6"></circle><path d="M8.5 14L7 22l5-3 5 3-1.5-8"></path></svg></span><h3>Artists fairly shown</h3><p class="muted">Each release gets its own page, proper credits and a description written for it.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv in"><div><span class="kicker">Journey</span><h2>How SOUND grew</h2></div></div><ol class="timeline"><li class="rv in"><span class="dot">1</span><div><h3>Idea</h3><p class="muted">SOUND Group sets out to build one home for new and old songs and videos.</p></div></li><li class="rv in"><span class="dot">2</span><div><h3>Catalogue</h3><p class="muted">Albums, artists, years, genres and languages are mapped so every title has a place.</p></div></li><li class="rv in"><span class="dot">3</span><div><h3>Community</h3><p class="muted">Listener accounts, ratings and reviews open up.</p></div></li><li class="rv in"><span class="dot">4</span><div><h3>Today</h3><p class="muted">New releases arrive every week in English and regional languages.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv in"><div><span class="kicker">Team</span><h2>Meet the team</h2></div></div><div class="team-grid"><div class="member rv in"><span class="avatar" style="width:84px;height:84px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,hsl(7,70%,48%),hsl(57,70%,34%));font-size:30px" aria-hidden="true">AM</span><h3>Ayesha Malik</h3><span class="muted">Chief Executive</span></div><div class="member rv in"><span class="avatar" style="width:84px;height:84px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,hsl(172,70%,48%),hsl(222,70%,34%));font-size:30px" aria-hidden="true">DR</span><h3>Daniyal Rauf</h3><span class="muted">Head of Music</span></div><div class="member rv in"><span class="avatar" style="width:84px;height:84px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,hsl(243,70%,48%),hsl(293,70%,34%));font-size:30px" aria-hidden="true">ZF</span><h3>Zoya Farooq</h3><span class="muted">Creative Director</span></div><div class="member rv in"><span class="avatar" style="width:84px;height:84px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,hsl(23,70%,48%),hsl(73,70%,34%));font-size:30px" aria-hidden="true">IS</span><h3>Imran Shah</h3><span class="muted">Lead Engineer</span></div></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap rv in"><h2>Want to work with us?</h2><p>Artists, labels and partners are welcome to get in touch.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn pri lg" href="contact.html">Contact us</a><a class="btn ghost lg" href="portfolio.html">See our work</a></div></div></section></main><footer class="foot"><div class="wrap"><div class="fgrid"><div><a class="logo" href="index.html"><i><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b></i>SOUND</a><p>New and old songs and videos, in English and your own language.</p></div><div><h4>Library</h4><a href="music.html">Music</a><a href="videos.html">Videos</a><a href="browse.html">Browse</a><a href="gallery.html">Gallery</a></div><div><h4>Company</h4><a href="about.html">About us</a><a href="services.html">Services</a><a href="portfolio.html">Portfolio</a><a href="blog.html">Blog and news</a></div><div><h4>Contact</h4><p>SOUND Group HQ, Main Boulevard, Lahore</p><p>+92 300 1234567</p><p>hello@sound.example</p><a href="contact.html">Send a message</a></div></div><div class="fbase"><span>© 2026 SOUND Group. All rights reserved.</span><span><a href="login.html">Log in</a> · <a href="register.html">Register</a></span></div></div></footer>
